{"id": "467bb1a8-ec38-44e3-b6bf-774c176e43ed", "slug": "nexus-landing-page-2", "title": "Nexus Landing Page", "description": "Nexus System Feature Section is designed for highlighting product capabilities and value points. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.", "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-staff-featured-2026-05-22\"\nname: \"Nexus Landing Page\"\ndescription: \"Nexus System Feature Section is designed for highlighting product capabilities and value points. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#E5E5E5\"\n  secondary: \"#0A0A0A\"\n  accent: \"#E5E5E5\"\n  background: \"#E5E5E5\"\n  surface: \"#E5E7EB\"\n  text-primary: \"#111827\"\n  text-secondary: \"#4B5563\"\n  border: \"#E5E7EB\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"8px\"\n  control: \"8px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# Nexus Landing Page\nSource: Neuform staff featured templates. Author: Sourasith Phomhome (@madebysourasith). Views: 262; favorites: 16; remixes: 4.\nTags: feature, section, animated, bento.\n## Overview\nNexus System Feature Section is designed for highlighting product capabilities and value points. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.\n\nSystem Dictates Function Logic precedes form Systems built on intent and rigorous structures translate complexity into order. 04 Align 2028 Order Emerges Algorithms that dictate form, depth, and direction in modern spac…\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: System Dictates Function; Order Emerges; Geometry Within Chaos.\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #E5E5E5, secondary #0A0A0A, accent #E5E5E5, background #E5E5E5, surface #E5E7EB, text-primary #111827. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Inter for display moments and Inter for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nCards, buttons, badges, navigation, and repeated blocks should preserve the source geometry, border treatment, and hover feel.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Nexus Landing Page</title>\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/three.js/r128/three.min.js\"></script>\n</head>\n<body class=\"bg-[#E5E5E5] min-h-screen flex items-center justify-center p-4 md:p-12 font-sans antialiased text-gray-900 selection:bg-black selection:text-white\">\n\n    <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6 w-full max-w-[1200px] mx-auto\">\n        \n        <!-- Card 1 -->\n        <div class=\"bg-white flex flex-col aspect-[2/3] lg:aspect-[3/4] xl:aspect-[2/3] relative overflow-hidden shadow-sm\">\n            <!-- Grid Background Overlay -->\n            <div class=\"absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none opacity-40 z-0\" style=\"background-image: linear-gradient(to right, #e5e7eb 1px, transparent 1px), linear-gradient(to bottom, #e5e7eb 1px, transparent 1px); background-size: 24px 24px;\"></div>\n            \n            <div class=\"p-6 md:p-8 flex-grow flex flex-col relative z-10\">\n                <div class=\"flex justify-between items-start mb-12\">\n                    <h1 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl tracking-tight uppercase leading-[0.9] font-semibold max-w-[80%]\">\n                        System<br>Dictates<br>Function\n                    </h1>\n                    <!-- Brand Icon -->\n                    <svg class=\"w-8 h-8 text-black\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\">\n                        <path d=\"M12 2L2 12l10 10 10-10L12 2zm0 5v10m-5-5h10\" />\n                    </svg>\n                </div>\n                \n                <div class=\"mt-auto\">\n                    <!-- Mid Bar -->\n                    <div class=\"bg-[#e5e5e5] flex justify-between items-center p-3 mb-2 rounded-sm\">\n                        <span class=\"text-xs font-mono uppercase tracking-widest text-gray-600\">Logic precedes form</span>\n                        <div class=\"bg-black text-white w-6 h-6 flex items-center justify-center rounded-sm\">\n                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:arrow-right-up-linear\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    \n                    <!-- Bottom Area -->\n                    <div class=\"flex gap-2 h-32 md:h-40\">\n                        <div class=\"bg-[#e5e5e5] flex-1 p-4 flex flex-col justify-between rounded-sm relative overflow-hidden\">\n                            <p class=\"text-[10px] text-gray-500 font-mono w-[80%]\">Systems built on intent and rigorous structures translate complexity into order.</p>\n                            <span class=\"text-6xl md:text-7xl tracking-tight font-medium leading-none\">04</span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"bg-[#e5e5e5] w-[35%] p-4 flex flex-col items-center justify-end rounded-sm relative overflow-hidden group\">\n                            <!-- Animated Blur Circle -->\n                            <div id=\"blur-circle\" class=\"absolute top-1/2 left-1/2 w-12 h-20 md:w-16 md:h-24 border-4 border-gray-400 rounded-full filter blur-[6px] opacity-60\" style=\"transform: translate(-50%, -50%);\"></div>\n                            <span class=\"text-xs font-mono uppercase tracking-widest text-gray-800 z-10 relative\">Align</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Card 2 (WebGL) -->\n        <div class=\"bg-[#0a0a0a] text-white flex flex-col aspect-[2/3] lg:aspect-[3/4] xl:aspect-[2/3] relative overflow-hidden shadow-sm\">\n            <!-- WebGL Container -->\n            <div id=\"webgl-container\" class=\"absolute inset-0 z-0 pointer-events-none\"></div>\n            \n            <div class=\"p-6 md:p-8 flex flex-col justify-between h-full relative z-10 pointer-events-none\">\n                <div class=\"text-xs font-mono text-gray-400\">2028</div>\n                \n                <div class=\"flex justify-between items-end mt-auto w-full\">\n                    <div class=\"flex flex-col\">\n                        <h2 class=\"text-4xl md:text-5xl tracking-tight uppercase leading-[0.9] font-semibold mb-2\">Order<br>Emerges</h2>\n                        <p class=\"text-[10px] text-gray-400 font-mono max-w-[200px]\">Algorithms that dictate form, depth, and direction in modern spaces.</p>\n                    </div>\n                    <!-- Brand Icon -->\n                    <svg class=\"w-8 h-8 text-white mb-2\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\">\n                        <path d=\"M12 2L2 12l10 10 10-10L12 2zm0 5v10m-5-5h10\" />\n                    </svg>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Card 3 -->\n        <div class=\"bg-white flex flex-col aspect-[2/3] lg:aspect-[3/4] xl:aspect-[2/3] relative overflow-hidden shadow-sm\">\n            <!-- Maze Container -->\n            <div class=\"h-1/2 bg-[#f4f4f4] relative overflow-hidden flex items-center justify-center\">\n                <!-- Inner rotating container for maze -->\n                <div id=\"maze-grid\" class=\"absolute grid gap-1 origin-center\" style=\"grid-template-columns: repeat(12, 1fr); width: 180%; height: 180%; transform: rotateX(55deg) rotateZ(45deg);\">\n                    <!-- Generated via JS -->\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            \n            <!-- Bottom Content -->\n            <div class=\"h-1/2 bg-[#0a0a0a] text-white p-6 md:p-8 flex flex-col justify-end\">\n                <h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl tracking-tight uppercase leading-[0.9] font-semibold mb-8 max-w-[90%]\">\n                    Geometry<br>Within<br>Chaos\n                </h2>\n                \n                <div class=\"flex justify-between items-end\">\n                    <p class=\"text-[10px] text-gray-400 font-mono max-w-[180px]\">A methodical approach to design that maps invisible boundaries.</p>\n                    <!-- Brand Icon -->\n                    <svg class=\"w-8 h-8 text-white\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\">\n                        <path d=\"M12 2L2 12l10 10 10-10L12 2zm0 5v10m-5-5h10\" />\n                    </svg>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n    </div>\n\n    <script>\n        // --- WebGL Setup for Card 2 ---\n        const initWebGL = () => {\n            const container = document.getElementById('webgl-container');\n            if (!container) return;\n\n            const scene = new THREE.Scene();\n            scene.background = new THREE.Color('#0a0a0a');\n            \n            const camera = new THREE.PerspectiveCamera(45, container.clientWidth / container.clientHeight, 0.1, 100);\n            camera.position.set(0, 0, 25);\n\n            const renderer = new THREE.WebGLRenderer({ antialias: true, alpha: true });\n            renderer.setSize(container.clientWidth, container.clientHeight);\n            renderer.shadowMap.enabled = true;\n            renderer.shadowMap.type = THREE.PCFSoftShadowMap;\n            container.appendChild(renderer.domElement);\n\n            // Lighting to create stark shadows like reference\n            const spotLight = new THREE.SpotLight(0xffffff, 2);\n            spotLight.position.set(0, 20, 10);\n            spotLight.angle = Math.PI / 4;\n            spotLight.penumbra = 0.8;\n            spotLight.castShadow = true;\n            spotLight.shadow.bias = -0.0001;\n            scene.add(spotLight);\n\n            const ambientLight = new THREE.AmbientLight(0xffffff, 0.2);\n            scene.add(ambientLight);\n\n            // Background plane for shadows\n            const planeGeo = new THREE.PlaneGeometry(100, 100);\n            const planeMat = new THREE.MeshStandardMaterial({ color: 0x0a0a0a });\n            const plane = new THREE.Mesh(planeGeo, planeMat);\n            plane.position.z = -2;\n            plane.receiveShadow = true;\n            scene.add(plane);\n\n            // Floating Geometry\n            const blocks = [];\n            const geo = new THREE.BoxGeometry(0.8, 4, 0.4);\n            const mat = new THREE.MeshStandardMaterial({ \n                color: 0xeeeeee,\n                roughness: 0.2,\n                metalness: 0.1\n            });\n\n            for (let i = 0; i < 16; i++) {\n                const mesh = new THREE.Mesh(geo, mat);\n                mesh.position.set(\n                    (Math.random() - 0.5) * 16,\n                    (Math.random() - 0.5) * 20,\n                    (Math.random() * 4)\n                );\n                mesh.rotation.set(\n                    Math.random() * Math.PI,\n                    Math.random() * Math.PI,\n                    (Math.random() - 0.5) * 0.5\n                );\n                mesh.castShadow = true;\n                mesh.receiveShadow = true;\n                scene.add(mesh);\n                \n                blocks.push({\n                    mesh,\n                    rx: (Math.random() - 0.5) * 0.01,\n                    ry: (Math.random() - 0.5) * 0.01,\n                    py: (Math.random() - 0.5) * 0.02\n                });\n            }\n\n            const animate = () => {\n                requestAnimationFrame(animate);\n                blocks.forEach(b => {\n                    b.mesh.rotation.x += b.rx;\n                    b.mesh.rotation.y += b.ry;\n                    b.mesh.position.y += b.py;\n                    if(b.mesh.position.y > 15) b.mesh.position.y = -15;\n                    if(b.mesh.position.y < -15) b.mesh.position.y = 15;\n                });\n                renderer.render(scene, camera);\n            };\n            animate();\n\n            // Handle resize\n            const resizeObserver = new ResizeObserver(() => {\n                camera.aspect = container.clientWidth / container.clientHeight;\n                camera.updateProjectionMatrix();\n                renderer.setSize(container.clientWidth, container.clientHeight);\n            });\n            resizeObserver.observe(container);\n        };\n\n        // --- Maze Generation for Card 3 ---\n        const initMaze = () => {\n            const grid = document.getElementById('maze-grid');\n            if (!grid) return;\n\n            const rows = 12;\n            const cols = 12;\n            const total = rows * cols;\n\n            for (let i = 0; i < total; i++) {\n                const cell = document.createElement('div');\n                cell.className = 'bg-white relative';\n                \n                // Create random geometric extrusions to simulate a 3D maze\n                if (Math.random() > 0.4) {\n                    const height = Math.floor(Math.random() * 3 + 1) * 10;\n                    cell.style.transform = `translateZ(${height}px)`;\n                    cell.style.boxShadow = '-8px 8px 16px rgba(0,0,0,0.15), inset 0 0 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.05)';\n                    cell.style.zIndex = height;\n                } else {\n                    cell.style.boxShadow = '-2px 2px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.05)';\n                }\n                \n                grid.appendChild(cell);\n            }\n\n            // Subtle rotation animation for the maze\n            let angle = 45;\n            const animateMaze = () => {\n                angle += 0.05;\n                grid.style.transform = `rotateX(55deg) rotateZ(${angle}deg)`;\n                requestAnimationFrame(animateMaze);\n            };\n            animateMaze();\n        };\n\n        // --- Card 1 Animations ---\n        const initCard1Anim = () => {\n            const circle = document.getElementById('blur-circle');\n            let scale = 1;\n            let growing = true;\n\n            const animateCircle = () => {\n                if(growing) {\n                    scale += 0.002;\n                    if(scale > 1.15) growing = false;\n                } else {\n                    scale -= 0.002;\n                    if(scale < 0.95) growing = true;\n                }\n                if(circle) {\n                    circle.style.transform = `translate(-50%, -50%) scale(${scale})`;\n                }\n                requestAnimationFrame(animateCircle);\n            };\n            animateCircle();\n        };\n\n        // Initialize scripts once DOM is fully parsed\n        document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {\n            initWebGL();\n            initMaze();\n            initCard1Anim();\n        });\n    </script>\n</body>\n</html>", "preview_file_name": "nexus-landing-page-2.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/staff-featured-2026-05-22/nexus-landing-page-2.jpg", "source_name": "nexus-landing-page-2-DESIGN.md", "views": 313, "forks": 6, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "5bd6211c-bd4c-467c-b442-4312cac4712c", "created_at": "2026-06-12T07:38:10.793894+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-07-03T13:19:12.222551+00:00"}